      "content": "that sounds good but maybe a bit too one-sided? i also want to include a section on the challenges of maintaining our traditional cultural heritage and national continuity while everything is changing so fast. do you think it's possible to mention how some people worry about losing our core identity without making the exhibit sound negative?",
